          "quote": "呼吸困难、出血不止"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave several appropriate post-chemotherapy emergency warnings, but did not explicitly include jaundice/dark urine or liver-related worsening despite chronic hepatitis B and entecavir being central to this case. This is a minor/moderate safety-boundary omission, not a serious error because no current jaundice or liver alarm symptom was reported.",
